    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36983" root="كسر" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكَسَّرٌ</span></b>  pass. part. n. of 2, q. v. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْسِرٌ</span>,
with which it is made synonymous. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  (tropical:)  A
valley <i>whose</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُسُور</span> (q. v.) <i>flow with water:</i> (K:)
or <i>are made to flow:</i> (Th:) accord. to one
relation of a saying in which it occurs, it is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكْسَرٌ</span>.
(TA.)

